# `exemptions.test.ts`'s own real cross-process concurrency test: a worker script has to live
# somewhere Node's ESM resolver can walk up from and find the real, workspace-linked `node_modules/`
# (ruling out the system tmpdir) but NOT inside `node_modules/` itself (Node refuses to strip types for
# a file under there) -- this is that one remaining place, repo-nested but outside `node_modules/`.
